      "writtenOn": "2025-02-18T17:20:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, we need to add all entrypoints that transition from the generated arm64 (quick) code to runtime or runtime to generated code right? Maybe we can expand the comment to say what entrypoints should be included here?\n\nAre these the only ones or we want to start with a smaller set for now?",
