      "writtenOn": "2025-02-27T16:55:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This list will only include functions which transition from quick -\u003e runtime, not the other way around. Transitions from runtime -\u003e quick will be handled by `CodeSimulatorArm64::Invoke` in the [stage 1 patch](https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/art/+/2680028/7/simulator/code_simulator_arm64.cc#217) which is called instead of [`art_quick_invoke*_stub`](https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/art/+/2680028/7/runtime/art_method.cc#426).\n\nThese are essentially the smallest possible set of entrypoints to start the runtime and run `2237-checker-simulator` for the [stage 1 setup patch](https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/art/+/2680028/7). This list will be expanded in future patches that expand the amount of code that we can simulate (e.g.: [stage 2.1](https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/art/+/2901291/5)).\n\nI\u0027ve expanded the comment to make this clearer.",
      "parentUuid": "3d1ee62d_fd625d4d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 102,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 102,
        "endChar": 60
      },
